   dependency in university students. Method : The Sample was made up of
   420 people, 122 men and 298 women between 20 and 38 years old, all
   university students. Results : The results indicate that violence is
   positively associated to dependency; also, the greater the violence
   received, the greater the violence exerted. Conclusion : Violence is
   related to the decrease in behaviors to maintain the relationship in the
   interaction and characteristics factors, and these three variables are
   related.},
